So the value of JSCOMPS goes through `vcardstructured_new_from_string`. The semicolons in the value create new fields. If there are more than 19 semicolons, num_fields exceeds 20 (VCARD_MAX_STRUCTURED_FIELDS), causing OOB write into the field array, and then in free, OOB read of uninitialized memory.

